    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a pretty stark difference in the scores. When you say Sample B sounds like they \"belong on a street corner,\" are you saying the dialect itself actually impacts how we perceive their intelligence or their ability to handle complex financial situations? Like, does the linguistic style make them seem less capable of understanding the actual business concepts mentioned?",
