      "content": "Yes, the dialect in Sample B immediately signals a lack of formal education and sophistication in the eyes of many, regardless of actual intelligence. The linguistic style suggests a lower social standing, which is often unconsciously equated with lower competence in high-stakes corporate environments. People are conditioned to associate formal, polished language with intelligence and the ability to manage complex, \"white-collar\" issues.",
